    "text": "By WRAL staff ,\n3 hours ago WRAL News has learned that a PTA treasurer was charged on Wednesday with embezzling thousands of dollars from the school where she worked for more than a year. According to court documents obtained by WRAL News, the Wake Forest Police Department arrested Anna-Marie Ethridge, 56, on Wednesday and charged her with felony embezzlement. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
